What is a Inventory management in sap mm
    Inventory Management in SAP MM is the component that deals with the monitoring and control of materials stock in real time. It manages quantities and values of materials across different storage locations and stock types—ensuring the right materials are available at the right time and place.

What Does Inventory Management Do?

It supports all goods movements:
---------------------------------
Goods Receipts (GR) – from purchase orders, production, etc.

Goods Issues (GI) – to production, sales, cost centers, etc.

Transfer Postings – between plants, storage locations, stock types.

Stock Adjustments – physical inventory, scrapping, returns.

